- **Views/surface** — 2×2 corner grid + verdict badge, gauge header + freshness chip/banner, and all six states (loading/empty/error/data/stale/offline). Semantic tokens only, full VoiceOver labels.
- **Previews/strings/Tests** — 9 preview states, 29 i18n keys, 40 XCTest cases.

